   "subject": "Announcement: Shinydashboard 0.6.0 is now on CRAN",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(84,84,84);font-family:Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><h2 style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:14pt;font-weight:700;line-height:22.4px;margin-bottom:5px;color:rgb(51,51,51)\"><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;line-height:1.4;font-size:13.3333px;font-weight:normal\">Shinydashboard 0.6.0 is now on CRAN! This release of shinydashboard was aimed at both fixing bugs and also bringing the package up to speed with users’ requests and Shiny itself (especially fully bringing <a href=\"https://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/bookmarking-state.html\" style=\"color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-width:initial;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/bookmarking-state.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389898958000&amp;usg=AOvVaw150XD0MnNuOtzY-8GS-Exl\">bookmarkable state</a> to shinydashboard’s sidebar). In addition to bug fixes and new features, we also added a <a href=\"https://rstudio.github.io/shinydashboard/behavior.html\" style=\"color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-width:initial;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rstudio.github.io/shinydashboard/behavior.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389898958000&amp;usg=AOvVaw28hJDxCqoKGj_uaXv1MAlk\">new “Behavior” section</a> to the <a href=\"https://rstudio.github.io/shinydashboard/\" style=\"color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-width:initial;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rstudio.github.io/shinydashboard/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389898958000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2zYBvoHQo0YP_lAfEaja6B\">shinydashboard website</a> to explain this release’s two biggest new features, and also to provide users with more material about shinydashboard-specific behavior.</p></h2><h2 style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;line-height:19.2px;border-bottom-width:initial;border-bottom-style:none;padding-bottom:0.1em;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">Sidebar</h2><h2 style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:14pt;font-weight:700;line-height:22.4px;margin-bottom:5px;color:rgb(51,51,51)\"><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;line-height:1.4;font-size:13.3333px;font-weight:normal\">This release introduces two new sidebar inputs. One of these inputs reports whether the sidebar is collapsed or expanded, and the other input reports which (if any) menu item in the side bar is expanded. In the screenshot below, the Charts tab is expanded.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;line-height:1.4;font-size:13.3333px;font-weight:normal\"><a href=\"https://rstudioblog.files.wordpress.com/2017/05/sidebar-expanded.png\" style=\"color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-width:initial;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rstudioblog.files.wordpress.com/2017/05/sidebar-expanded.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389898958000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2HWmqnyxm0hNM8KTCCuh7l\"><img src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/PdQN_I3KZ7GX_aNdlQvJJGWysedtA0YyXZIrBUAXggz6L80APiQUYgiHoDJQyriYCNcAlPZLBrVaM8BJdv9FFY3C18XyxjahNhvAgL75CJgAknf_kogGkLo9jibp=s0-d-e1-ft#https://rstudioblog.files.wordpress.com/2017/05/sidebar-expanded.png?w=490\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"></a></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;line-height:1.4;font-size:13.3333px;font-weight:normal\">These inputs are unusual since they’re automatically available without you needing to declare them, and they have a fixed name. The first input is accessible via <code style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;,Courier,monospace;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(68,68,68)\">input$sidebarCollapsed</code> and can have only two values: <code style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;,Courier,monospace;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(68,68,68)\">TRUE</code>, which indicates that the sidebar is collapsed, and <code style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;,Courier,monospace;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(68,68,68)\">FALSE</code>, which indicates that it is expanded (default).</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;line-height:1.4;font-size:13.3333px;font-weight:normal\">The second input is accessible via <code style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;,Courier,monospace;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(68,68,68)\">input$sidebarItemExpanded</code>. If no <code style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;,Courier,monospace;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(68,68,68)\">menuItem()</code> in the sidebar is currently expanded, the value of this input is <code style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;,Courier,monospace;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(68,68,68)\">NULL</code>. Otherwise, <code style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;,Courier,monospace;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(68,68,68)\">input$sidebarItemExpanded</code> holds the value of the <code style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;,Courier,monospace;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(68,68,68)\">expandedName</code> of whichever <code style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;,Courier,monospace;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(68,68,68)\">menuItem()</code> is currently expanded (<code style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;,Courier,monospace;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(68,68,68)\">expandedName</code>is a new argument to <code style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;,Courier,monospace;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(68,68,68)\">menuItem()</code>; if none is provided, shinydashboard creates a sensible default).</p></h2><h2 style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;line-height:19.2px;border-bottom-width:initial;border-bottom-style:none;padding-bottom:0.1em;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">Full changes</h2><h2 style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:14pt;font-weight:700;line-height:22.4px;margin-bottom:5px;color:rgb(51,51,51)\"><p style=\"line-height:1.4;font-size:13.3333px;font-weight:normal\">As usual, you can view the full changelog for shinydashboard in the <a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/shinydashboard/blob/v0.6.0/NEWS.md\" style=\"color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-width:initial;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/shinydashboard/blob/v0.6.0/NEWS.md&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389898958000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1s4QBnwVAwtl94FniYcZ18\">NEWS</a> file.</p></h2></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  }
